<title>GREECE: Greek Jan C/A posts $21mln deficit- Bank of Greece.</title>
<headline>Greek Jan C/A posts $21mln deficit- Bank of Greece.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's current account balance registered a deficit of $21 million in January 1997 from a surplus of $363.7 million in the same month in 1996, the Bank of Greece said in a statement.</p>
<p>The trade deficit rose 14.1 percent to $1.598 billion in January 1997 from $1.4 billion in the same month a year ago, it said.</p>
</text>
